    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ninkii Ilaah Oo Ka Yimid Yahuudah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa waxaa Yahuudah ka yimid nin Ilaah oo Eraygii Rabbiga ku yimid Beytel; oo Yaaraabcaamna wuxuu ag taagnaa meeshii allabariga inuu foox shido aawadeed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu wax ka gees ah meeshii allabariga ku qayliyey sidii Rabbigu ku amray, oo wuxuu yidhi, Meeshii allabarigay, meeshii allabarigay, Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Reer Daa'uud waxaa u dhalan doona wiil magiciisa la yidhaahdo Yoosiyaah, oo isna dushaada wuxuu ku qali doonaa wadaaddada meelaha sarsare ee dushaada fooxa ku shida, oo waxaa dushaada lagu gubi doonaa dad lafihiis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isla maalintaasba calaamad buu tusay oo wuxuu yidhi, Tanu waa calaamaddii Rabbigu ku hadlay: Bal ogaada, meesha allabarigu way kala dillaaci doontaa oo dambaska saaranuna wuu soo daadan doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markii boqorkii maqlay hadalkii ninka Ilaah uu ku qayliyey ee ka geesta ahaa meeshii allabariga oo Beytel ku tiil ayuu Yaaraabcaam gacanta ka soo fidiyey meeshii allabariga oo wuxuu yidhi, War ninka qabta. Oo gacantii uu isaga ku fidiyeyna way qallashay, mar dambena wuu soo laabi kari waayay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo meeshii allabariguna way kala dillaacday, oo dambaskiina wuu ka soo daatay meeshii allabariga, sidii calaamaddii uu ninka Ilaah bixiyey ee Rabbigu ku amray. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii ugu jawaabay ninkii Ilaah, Haddaba Rabbiga Ilaahaaga ah raallinimo iiga bari, oo ii ducee in gacantaydu ii soo noqoto aawadeed. Markaasaa ninkii Ilaah Rabbiga baryay, oo boqorkiina gacantiisii way u soo noqotay, oo waxay u noqotay sidii ay markii hore ahayd. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dabadeedna boqorkii wuxuu ninkii Ilaah ku yidhi, Kaalay, guriga ii raac, oo isqabooji, oo anna waan kuu abaal gudayaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkaasaa ninkii Ilaah wuxuu boqorkii ku yidhi, Xataa haddaad gurigaaga badhkiis i siinayso ku raaci maayo, oo innaba kibisna ku cuni maayo, biyona ka cabbi maayo meeshan; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waayo, Erayga Rabbiga ayaa saas igu amray, oo yidhi, Waa inaadan kibis cunin, biyona cabbin, waana inaadan dib u sii qaadin jidkii aad soo martay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sidaas daraaddeed jid kaluu maray, dib umana uu sii qaadin jidkii uu Beytel u soo maray. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waagaas waxaa Beytel degganaa nebi duq ah, oo wiilashiisii midkood baa u yimid oo u soo sheegay kulli shuqulladii ninka Ilaah maalintaas Beytel ku sameeyey; oo erayadii uu boqorka kula hadlayna aabbahood way u soo sheegeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa aabbahood ku yidhi, Jidkee buu qaaday? Oo wiilashiisuna way arkeen jidkii ninkii Ilaah oo Yahuudah ka yimid qaaday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu wiilashiisii ku yidhi, War dameerka ii kooreeya. Dameerkiina way u kooreeyeen oo isna wuu fuulay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo ninkii Ilaah wuu daba galay, oo helay isagoo geed hoos fadhiya; kolkaasuu ku yidhi, War ma waxaad tahay ninkii Ilaah oo Yahuudah ka yimid? Isna wuxuu yidhi, Haah, waan ahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu ku yidhi, Kaalay oo gurigaygii ii raac aad kibis soo cuntide. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isna wuxuu yidhi, Kari maayo inaan kula noqdo iyo inaan gurigaaga galo toona. Halkan innaba kibis kugula cuni maayo, biyona kugula cabbi maayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, erayga Rabbigu wuxuu igu yidhi, Waa inaadan meeshaas kibis ku cunin, biyona ka cabbin, jidkii aad soo martayna dib ha u sii qaadin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isna wuxuu ku yidhi, War anba waxaan ahay nebi kula mid ah, oo malaa'ig baa Eraygii Rabbiga igula hadashay oo igu tidhi, Isaga soo celi oo gurigaaga keen inuu kibis cuno oo biyo cabbo. Laakiinse been buu u sheegay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed wuu la noqday, oo gurigiisii buu kibis ka cunay, biyona ka cabbay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa intay miiska wada fadhiyeen uu eraygii Rabbigu u yimid nebigii soo celiyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuuna ku qayliyey ninkii Ilaah oo Yahuudah ka yimid, oo ku yidhi, Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Caasi baad ku noqotay Rabbiga, mana aadan xajin amarkii Rabbiga Ilaahaaga ahu kugu amray, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "laakiinse waad soo noqotay oo kibis baad ku cuntay, biyona waad ku cabtay meeshii uu kugu yidhi, Kibis ha ku cunin, biyona ha ku cabbin. Sidaas daraaddeed meydkaagu gaadhi maayo xabaashii awowayaashaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markuu kibis cunay oo biyo cabbay dabadeed ayuu dameerkiisii u kooreeyey nebigii uu soo celiyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markuu ka tegey ayaa libaax jidkii kaga hor yimid, wuuna dilay isagii; oo meydkiisiina waxaa lagu tuuray jidka dhexdiisa, oo dameerkiina wuu ag taagnaa; libaaxiina wuxuu dhinac taagnaa meydka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo bal eeg, dad baa soo ag maray, oo waxay arkeen meydka jidka lagu tuuray iyo libaaxa meydka agtiisa taagan; oo waxay yimaadeen magaaladii nebiga duqa ahu degganaa, markaasay dadkii u sheegeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo nebigii isaga jidka ka soo celiyey markuu taas maqlay ayuu yidhi, Waa ninkii Ilaah oo ku caasiyoobay Rabbiga; oo sidaas daraaddeed ayuu Rabbigu isaga ugu gacan gashay libaaxa dildillaacsaday oo dilay, taasuna waa sidii uu ahaa erayguu Rabbigu kula hadlay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu wiilashiisii la hadlay oo ku yidhi, War dameerka ii kooreeya. Oo iyana way u kooreeyeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkaasuu tegey oo wuxuu helay meydkiisii oo jidka dhex yaal, iyo dameerkii iyo libaaxii oo meydka ag taagan; libaaxiina meydkii ma cunin, dameerkiina ma dildillaacsan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo nebigiina wuxuu qaaday meydkii ninkii Ilaah, oo kor saaray dameerkii, wuuna soo celiyey. Markaasuu yimid magaaladii nebigii duqa ahaa inuu halkaas ku aaso oo ugu baroorto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo xabaashiisii uu isagu lahaa ayuu meydkiisii geliyey, wayna u baroorteen, oo yidhaahdeen, Hoognay, walaalkayow! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markuu aasay dabadeed ayuu wiilashiisii la hadlay oo ku yidhi, Markaan dhinto igu xabaala xabaashii ninkii Ilaah lagu xabaalay, oo lafahayga lafihiisa ag dhiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
